This product includes flag artwork derived from flag-icons.

  flag-icons — https://github.com/lipis/flag-icons
  Copyright (c) 2013 Panayiotis Lipiridis
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The paths for the eight flags in DEFAULT_PHONE_COUNTRIES (US, GB, FI, NG,
DE, FR, IN, JP) are taken from that project's 4x3 set and inlined as React
components in src/flags.tsx. No flag-icons code is bundled and the package
has no dependency on it.

