This product includes card network artwork derived from
svg-credit-card-payment-icons.

  svg-credit-card-payment-icons
  https://github.com/aaronfagan/svg-credit-card-payment-icons
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The Visa, Mastercard, American Express and Discover marks in
src/card-marks.tsx are taken from that project's flat set and inlined as
React components. No upstream code is bundled and the package has no
dependency on it.

Visa, Mastercard, American Express and Discover are trademarks of their
respective owners. They are reproduced here to indicate which card a number
belongs to. A production checkout should use the assets each network
distributes under its own brand guidelines; the CardInput component's
`brand` prop accepts any node for that purpose.
